  // Characters
  "characters.clementine.displayName": "Clementine",

  // Event dialogues (Character Intro)
  "events.caretakerIntro.greeting": "Heya neighbor! Hopin' I didn't sneak up on ya.$h",
  "events.caretakerIntro.introduction": "Name's Clementine, but folks just call me Clem. I'm yer new neighbor, over at the old campin' park down south.#$b#Well, 'neighbor' in the country sense. Close enough to borrow sugar, far enough ya gotta really want it!$h",
  "events.caretakerIntro.backstory": "Ya might be wonderin' what brings me to these parts. Well, that'd be my Granny's doing...#$b#That old campin' park used to be hers, back in the day. She sent a letter askin' me to look after the place.#$b#Her way of tellin' me it was time to put my roots down somewhere, I s'pose.$h",
  "events.caretakerIntro.parkOpen": "Anyhow, I came by to tell ya the park's open! Still got some patchin' up to do, but if campin' sounds like yer kinda thing, stop on by sometime.",
  "events.caretakerIntro.grandpa": "Ya know Granny used to talk about yer grandpa now and again. Always said he was a kind and hardworkin' man.#$b#Kinda nice, ain't it? Them knowin' each other back then, and here we are, neighbors.",
  "events.caretakerIntro.farewell": "Well, it was nice meetin' ya, @! See ya around.$h",

  // Event dialogues (Character Intro)
  "events.campingIntro.greeting": "Heya @! Welcome to the Cindersap Forest Park.$h",
  "events.campingIntro.campsites": "So, ya ready to start campin'?#$b#First things first, ya gotta pick a campsite. Did ya see that board with the little flag out front?#$b#It'll have all the available campsites, includin' the time it'll take to reach 'em.#$b#Now, fair warnin': not every campsite's a walk away. Granny's old car's sittin' in the garage for ya to use... once she gets some fixin'.$s#$b#Since yer just startin' out, let me grab some things for ya.",
  "events.campingIntro.searching": "Now where did I leave 'em...",
  "events.campingIntro.starterKit": "Here, a little starter kit! Can't have ya starvin' or sleepin' under a bush out there.$h",
  "events.campingIntro.starterKitMessage": "Clementine hands you a small tent and some rations.",
  "events.campingIntro.rations": "Now, about those camp rations. Out at camp, ya can't exactly run back to yer kitchen when ya start feelin' hungry. That's what rations are for!#$b#I sell 'em right here in the shop, along with other supplies. Use 'em at the campfire to cook yerself up somethin' warm.$h",
  "events.campingIntro.map": "Let's get ya pointed to yer first campsite. Here, take this map...",
  "events.campingIntro.campsite": "Nothin' fancy out there, but it's a quiet spot with a workin' firepit and more stars than ya can count. Reckon that's plenty.$h#$b#If ya want a friend to tag along, grab a visitor pass from my shop.",
  "events.campingIntro.campingNotes": "Oh, before I forget!#$b#I put together some notes into a little guide for ya. Hopin' it'll come in handy!$h",
  "events.campingIntro.farewell": "Well, that's about everything! Thank ya for stoppin' by, @.#$b#And happy campin'!$h",

